'''Ancient Egg: N004''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] and can be unlocked when beating [[Empress' Excavation 3]]. Its [[True Form]] was added in the same update which massively improves stats across the board and gives a guaranteed chance to knockback enemies, break barriers, and pierce through shields.

